m_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/79377a327f9165ed588e46700b9579f1.mp4?t=1736881475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Participate in races, take prizes and improve your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/6d469f425937ef60f3b51e6e9a3896dd.poster.avif?t=1736881475\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/6d469f425937ef60f3b51e6e9a3896dd.webm?t=1736881475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/6d469f425937ef60f3b51e6e9a3896dd.mp4?t=1736881475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fair way or bypass maneuvers? You decide how to get to the finals and what you are willing to sacrifice for the cherished goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/d07787384d7f37538b761d3bb7d24265.poster.avif?t=1736881475\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/d07787384d7f37538b761d3bb7d24265.webm?t=1736881475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320490/extras/d07787384d7f37538b761d3bb7d24265.mp4?t=1736881475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
